{
  "firma": "024768beb699",
  "duracion": 49.04,
  "frases": [
    {
      "n": 1,
      "texto": "Why is your faucet dripping, and how do you fix it in five minutes?",
      "clave": "dripping",
      "inicio": 0,
      "fin": 3.84
    },
    {
      "n": 2,
      "texto": "One drip a second wastes over three thousand gallons a year.",
      "clave": "gallons",
      "inicio": 3.92,
      "fin": 7.44
    },
    {
      "n": 3,
      "texto": "That's a hundred and eighty showers, lost to one tiny rubber washer.",
      "clave": "washer",
      "inicio": 7.52,
      "fin": 11.6
    },
    {
      "n": 4,
      "texto": "Inside, that washer squeezes against a seat to hold the water back.",
      "clave": "squeezes",
      "inicio": 11.88,
      "fin": 15.52
    },
    {
      "n": 5,
      "texto": "After years of squeezing, it goes hard and flat, and water sneaks past.",
      "clave": "flat",
      "inicio": 15.68,
      "fin": 20.213
    },
    {
      "n": 6,
      "texto": "So here's the fix. First, shut off the water under the sink, then open the faucet to drain it.",
      "clave": "shut",
      "inicio": 20.347,
      "fin": 26.04
    },
    {
      "n": 7,
      "texto": "Plug the drain so nothing gets lost, pop off the cap, and unscrew the handle.",
      "clave": "plug",
      "inicio": 26.08,
      "fin": 30.613
    },
    {
      "n": 8,
      "texto": "Then loosen the big nut with a wrench, and pull out the stem.",
      "clave": "nut",
      "inicio": 30.747,
      "fin": 33.96
    },
    {
      "n": 9,
      "texto": "Unscrew the old washer, and put on a new one of the same size.",
      "clave": "same",
      "inicio": 34,
      "fin": 37.24
    },
    {
      "n": 10,
      "texto": "Put it all back, turn the water on slowly, and the drip is gone.",
      "clave": "gone",
      "inicio": 37.28,
      "fin": 41.16
    },
    {
      "n": 11,
      "texto": "A washer that costs about a dollar just saved you three thousand gallons a year.",
      "clave": "dollar",
      "inicio": 41.2,
      "fin": 45.573
    },
    {
      "n": 12,
      "texto": "Send this to that friend whose faucet won't stop dripping.",
      "clave": "dripping",
      "inicio": 45.627,
      "fin": 48.24
    }
  ],
